# Lecture 08F

## Three Point Test Cross

## Chapter 8

## Dr. Neil Voss

## October 27, 2026

=== layout: bookend

# Learning Objectives

@body

- Identify parental and double-crossover offspring.
- Find the middle gene from double crossovers.
- Summarize offspring by chromosome interval.
- Include double crossovers in both map distances.

