# *What is the proper gene order?*

@top-left

- Parental types\:
- b + +
- + n s

@top-right

- Double crossovers
- + + +
- b n s

@bottom

=> appear
- N B S or S B N

=== include: repo:genetics/evergreen/three_point_testcross_steps.djot

=== include: repo:genetics/evergreen/three_point_gene_order_steps.djot

=== layout: two-over-one-panels

# *What is the proper gene order?*

@top-left

- Parental types\:
- a b c^+^
- a^+^ b^+^ c

@top-right

- Double crossovers
- a^+^ b c^+^
- a b^+^ c

@bottom

=> appear
- B A C or C A B

