# *Step 5\: Find distance between genes*

@body

![Slide image 12](assets/lect08f-3_point_testcross_textbook/image_012.png)

- *distance between lz and su genes*

![Slide image 13](assets/lect08f-3_point_testcross_textbook/image_013.png)

- 79 of 740 have crossovers between lz and su.
- 79/740 = 10.7 m.u.

- *distance between su and gl genes*

- 109 of 740 have crossovers between su and gl.
- 109/740 = 14.7 m.u.

![Slide image 14](assets/lect08f-3_point_testcross_textbook/image_014.png)

