=== layout: section

# Summary

=== layout: bookend

# Key Takeaways

@body

- Identify parental and double-crossover types first.
- Compare parental and double-crossover combinations to find the middle gene.
- Count recombinant offspring for each interval.
- Include double crossovers in both interval distances when constructing the map.

